  "reason": "Existing evidence is sparse, so this experiment tests the baseline effectiveness of a multimodal (RNA + image) multiprofile setup with scgpt and imagenet_vit_l encoders, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion. It isolates the impact of multimodal integration and advanced encoders, which are critical design choices with high uncertainty. This provides foundational insights before exploring more complex variations."
